  "content": {
    "title": "McDonald's releases BTS TinyTAN Happy Meal with toys: How to get it",
    "text": "Updated Sept. 3, 2025, 8:13 a.m. ETK-pop fans can now indulge in a BTS-inspired Happy Meal for a limited time at McDonald's.The fast food chain released the first edition of the TinyTAN Happy Meal, which includes a line of characters resembling each member of BTS, on Sept. 3.A second edition of the TinyTAN Happy Meal, the Encore Edition, will be available starting Sept. 23.BTS, also known as the Bangtan Boys, is a mega famous boy band from South Korea comprised of Jin, Suga, J-Hope, RM, Jimin, V and Jungkook. The group has racked up five Grammy Award nominations, 26 million monthly Spotify listeners and 23 Guinness World Records.\"McDonald’s fans, you asked and we delivered,\" the company said in a news release announcing the meal on Aug. 19. McDonald's previously collaborated with the singers for a popular BTS Meal in 2021.How many editions of the McDonald's TinyTAN Happy Meal are there?There are two editions of the TinyTAN Happy Meal: the Throwback Edition and Encore Edition. The versions also have two different release dates at McDonald's restaurants and will feature different toys.The Throwback Edition, which is available first, features each TinyTAN character wearing the promo outfits used for the 2021 BTS Meal.The other, the Encore Edition, will have each character in outfits that nod to the latest collaboration, McDonald's said.How to get the McDonald's BTS TinyTAN Happy Meal and toysThe Happy Meal can be purchased in person or on the McDonald's app, which is free to download, at participating restaurants.The meal is available in nearly 70 countries, including the United States, but will only be sold for a limited time, McDonald's said.Customers who buy one of the meals can also scan a code on the box, directing them to the TinyTAN Power Up game.This story has been updated to add new information.Melina Khan is a national trending reporter for USA TODAY. She can be reached at melina.khan@usatoday.com.",
